The first Ethereum Classic community survey since 2019 is open. The last one got 32 responses.

It’s for holders, miners, builders, node operators, and anyone who’s stepped away. 10 minutes, 9 languages, every question optional.

Finish it for a thank-you NFT and a chance at 8.88 ETC, sponsored by @ETCGrantsDao.